India's GDP growth over the last 5 full financial years swings from a Covid dip of about -5.8% in FY21 to a high of about 9.7% in FY22, then settles near 6.5% in FY25. These are rounded figures from memory and official numbers get revised, so check the latest release from the statistics ministry if you need exact values.

